# MCP Servers

- One concern per server: `vision` | `report` | `geo` | `fraud` | `chat`.
- Stdio MCP only; keep tool schemas explicit and versionable.
- Servers wrap services/pipelines — no duplicate business logic inside prompts.
- Geo: PostGIS `ST_DWithin` ≤ 5 km; accept client-fuzzed GPS (±500 m), never store raw home GPS if avoidable.
- Fraud tools must be deterministic where possible (counts, cooldowns, thresholds from config).
- Chat tools provision rooms only after PASS; no vault media in chat payloads.
